==Description==
The '''Void Crate''' is a [[Crates|crate]] that can be purchased for {{Gem|1,000}} in the store.

==Appearance==
The '''Void Crate''' is a black, purple and gold chest covered in purple vines with flowers on them and multiple crystals growing around it. It is opened by a sword.

