==Trivia==
*The '''Void Crate''' is unique as the opening animation slightly changes based on the rarity of the skin gotten, with the color of smoke coming out of the crate changing.
**While in most cases, this is just the same color as the skin rarity, for {{Color|Legendary}}, it is instead yellow, as it does not use skin rarity colors as a base but the different set of rarities primarily used by consumables, where {{Color|LegendaryConsumable}} is yellow.
***There is also a variant of the opening animation, that being an {{Color|Epic}} opening animation which is purple. However, as no skin in the game has ever used this as a rarity, this goes unused.<ref>https://x.com/BardVfx_x/status/2064063300539711796</ref>
*The '''Void Crate''' is the first skin crate in the game to cost {{Gem|Gems}}.
**It is also the first non-tower item to cost {{Gem|Gems}}.

